        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 4.5MW, onshore, tower</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 4.5MW, onshore, tower
UUID=5cfeacc6-cd82-32ff-a988-4943ac946c26
Wind turbine tower, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Vestas V163-4.5MW onshore wind turbine (Martinez Aguado &amp; Garrett, 2025).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5cfeacc6-cd82-32ff-a988-4943ac946c26.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
